<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ContainEye - Features Walkthrough - hannesnagel</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
    <style>
        .subnav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 100px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .subnav-link {
            color: var(--secondary-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .subnav-link:hover, .subnav-link.active {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            background: rgba(74, 144, 226, 0.1);
        }
        .doc-content {
            text-align: left;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .doc-item {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 40px;
            padding: 3rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }
        .doc-content h2, .doc-content h3 { color: var(--text-color); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .doc-content h2 { font-size: 2rem; }
        .doc-content h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
        .doc-content p, .doc-content li { color: var(--secondary-color); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .screenshot-box {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 2rem 0;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 1rem;
        }
        .screenshot-box img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
        <div id="site-nav"></div>

    <main class="page">
        <section id="hero">
            <div class="reveal">
                <span class="sub-header">In-Depth Walkthrough</span>
                <h1>Features - Part 2</h1>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="reveal container-wrapper">
                <div class="subnav">
                    <a href="/containeye/index" class="subnav-link">Overview</a>
                    <a href="/containeye/features" class="subnav-link active">Features</a>
                    <a href="/containeye/ssh-terminal" class="subnav-link">SSH Terminal</a>
                    <a href="/containeye/servers-management" class="subnav-link">Servers</a>
                    <a href="/containeye/automated-tests" class="subnav-link">Tests</a>
                    <a href="/containeye/faq" class="subnav-link">FAQ</a>
                    <a href="/containeye/support" class="subnav-link">Support</a>
                </div>

                <div class="doc-content">
                    <div class="doc-item">
                        <h2>Automated Peace of Mind</h2>
                        <p>Stay ahead of issues with automated checks. Tests run a command over SSH — or check a URL — and validate the output. Green means good, red means it's time to act.</p>

                        <div class="screenshot-box">
                            <img src="/images/containeye-framed/active-tests.png" alt="Active tests list">
                        </div>

                        <h3>Creating Tests Your Way</h3>
                        <p>Describe what to check in plain language and the Agentic assistant drafts, verifies, and creates the test in one chat session — or add one of 13 built-in suggestions (website status, disk space, SSL expiry, MySQL, pending updates, and more) with a single tap.</p>

                        <h3>AI-Assisted Validation</h3>
                        <p>No more regex trial and error. The AI proposes the expected output pattern for your service's output — matched as a regex when it compiles, otherwise as an exact string. You can adapt the command, expected output, or target server any time.</p>

                        <div class="screenshot-box">
                            <img src="/images/containeye-framed/configure-suggested-test.png" alt="AI test config">
                        </div>

                        <h3>Run Them Anywhere</h3>
                        <p>Run tests from the app (<strong>Run All</strong> or per test), from the home-screen <strong>Test Widget</strong>, or via the <strong>Test Servers</strong> and <strong>Run a single Test</strong> Shortcuts actions — all without opening the app. ContainEye also attempts background checks when iOS allows.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/components.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
